# Build context for deploy/images/Dockerfile, which is built from the repository root.
# This is an allowlist: exclude everything, then re-include only what that Dockerfile
# uses. It builds ./cmd/{platformd,platformd-dev,agentd,executord,platformctl} with
# GOWORK=off, so it needs go.mod, go.sum and the Go packages under api/, cmd/ and
# internal/. go:embed files always live inside their package directory, so they are
# covered too. Re-include a path here when the Dockerfile starts to COPY or build it.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!api/
!cmd/
!internal/

# Never send local dependencies or environment files, even from re-included trees.
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
